Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈可是个美女啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom is a babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 温彻斯特家的小子 - 你怎么来这儿了 下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, winchester! son of a bitch! - How you doin', corporal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 D先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mr.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来有一点疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna sound a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽是我的妈妈 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mary is my mother. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am your grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是玛丽和约翰 温彻斯特的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents are mary and John winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道你在说啥 - 玛丽是被黄眼魔鬼杀掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - Mary gets killed by a yellow-eyed demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.37,0:00:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想得到那些人的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want those people's souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我只是想得到他们的孩子 - 为什么选他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, i just want their children. - Why any of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会盯着他们的婴儿床\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stand over their crib,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我会把我的血灌进他们的嘴巴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna bleed into their mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你一直在用那个奇怪的预知未来的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you've been using your freaky e.s.p. stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 你不想我在这条路上走下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you didn't want me to go down that road,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就不会走这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I didn't go down that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们就保持这这样子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道是亚撒色对你弟弟做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what azazel did to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.47,0:00:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we don't know is why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.07,0:00:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你弟弟走上了一条不归路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother is heading down a dangerous road, Dean, so stop it…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so stop it…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:00:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然我们就动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.84,0:01:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.24,0:01:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你我就会万事小心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd watch myself if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.54,0:01:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是萨姆 温彻斯特 大英雄先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're sam winchester, mr. big hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.47,0:01:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而这就是你 和一些魔鬼鬼混\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet here you are, slutting around with some demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「真正的英雄」 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Real hero. - Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说没有你哥哥的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about those months without your brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有所有关于你还有这个婊子在暗处里进行的勾当\N{\fnArial\fs30}About all the things you and this demon bitch do in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样 跟我说说吧 大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? tell me, hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第4季第4集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.74,0:02:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错 头不痛了 一点都不痛了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. no more headaches. none?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.90,0:03:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你身边 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.17,0:03:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你有什么事情要告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you want to tell me, sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 等等 好吗 让我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hold on, okay? just let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说让我来解释是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gonna say, "let me explain"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想解释这档子事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不从她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you start with who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这里他妈的发生了什么事开始说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what the hell is she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你真高兴啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you again, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是露比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.27,0:04:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是很听这个小贱人的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aren't you an obedient little bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.90,0:04:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比 他很受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby…he's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想去其他地方先\N{\fnArial\fs30}The e.r…unless you want to go another round first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 你要走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Are you… are you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要我了 你跟露比去解决恶魔就好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need me. you and ruby go fight demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 迪恩 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Dean, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.27,0:05:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你满意了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道你已经偏离我们原来的生活有多远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know how far off the reservation you've gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,离正常有多远 还是里正常人有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far from normal? from human?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在驱魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just exorcising demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把他们送回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can send them back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是和魔鬼联手 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only works with demons, and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.47,0:05:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能做什么 我已经告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else can you do?! I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有什么理由去相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have every reason in the world to believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 我早就该说些什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, i should have said something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我很对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是试着看看事情的另一面 另一面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But try to see the other side here. the other side?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在将魔鬼从无辜的人们的身体里驱逐出去 用这把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pulling demons out of innocent people. use the knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把到把无辜的人也杀掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The knife kills the victim!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我这么做 大多数人都能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do, most of them survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这五个月里救活的人比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've saved more people in the last five months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过去一年里救的人都多\N{\fnArial\fs30}than we save in a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那露比要你去想些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That what ruby wants you to think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用什么方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like the way she tricked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗你去使用你的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}into using your powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 滑坡效应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slippery slope, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为越来越黑暗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's gonna get darker and darker,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.43,0:06:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝知道什么时候要结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}and god knows where it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.24,0:06:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让这走得太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let it go too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 这已经走得很远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already gone too far, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't know you…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想要去找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…i would want to hunt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的猎人也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so would other hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死过一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要继续在没有你的陪伴下作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to keep on fighting without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我现在做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what I'm doing…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是这么棒的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's so terrific…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么为什么你当初要骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why'd you lie about it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么天使说告诉我要去阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did an angel tell me to stop you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.97,0:07:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥说我不来阻止你 他就会亲自动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cas said that if I don't stop you, he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, what that means,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 这意味着上帝不愿意让你做这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, that means that god doesn't want you doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你还要跟我争\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are you just gonna stand there and.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说这一切都是好的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me that everything is all good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.40,0:08:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 特拉维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, travis. yeah, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 听到你的声音真好 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…it's good to hear your voice, too, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 等等 现在我有点事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, look, it's not a really good time right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好吧 给我具体的地址 还有 迦太基 密苏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, just give me the details, and, uh carthage, missouri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,找杰克·蒙哥马利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for jack montgomery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你觉得很难下咽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, are you stoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 很好吃 我饿得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? it's good. I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有甜品吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is…is there dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚弄好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just so happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:08:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:09:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你还吃剩下的牛排吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? are you gonna finish your steak?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧 你都吃完两份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding, right? you've had two already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚 我只是还饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I'm just…hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你肚子里长了绦虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you have tapeworm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never felt better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 老妈 是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it. mom a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是我亲眼看到我也不会相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have believed it, either, if I hadn't seen it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女人厉害着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That woman could kick some ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 她差点把我放倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she almost took me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起来怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd she look?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 她快乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…was she happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 她好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,既可爱又聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny and smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,前途无限\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hopeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 直到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until, of course…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.60,0:10:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 现在我们发现我们父母 以及外祖父母全都是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just our parents, and now we find out our grandparents, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们整个家族都被杀了 但是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our whole family murdered, and for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个黄眼要到我的婴儿房里还滴血到我嘴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So yellow eyes could get in my nursery and bleed in my mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我从没说过任何关于恶魔之血的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, i never said anything about demon blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就知道了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 已经一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, for about a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,整整一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道应该告诉你的 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have told you. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.47,0:11:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近说了很多次这样的话了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been saying that a lot lately, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想告诉我的话 你完全不必说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to tell me, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那没关系 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's fine. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.87,0:11:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝儿 什么时候开饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, babe, when's dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,45分钟之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.47,0:11:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 一顿美味的家常饭不同于速食食品和外卖 需要等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, a delicious, unmicrowaved, non-takeout, homemade meal is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定就是这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure that's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里就一个杰克·蒙哥马利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only jack montgomery in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're looking for…?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,特拉维斯只是说留意任何怪异之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travis said to keep an eye out for anything weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:12:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 怪异和不怪异的我都见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, yeah, I've seen big weird, little weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是怪异到癫狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird with crazy on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这家伙 就我看 得了 这家伙正常得要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this guy? I mean, come on, this guy's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚 迪恩 特拉维斯说得煞有其事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean. travis seemed pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说这真是够怪异的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say that qualifies as weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.97,0:13:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,特拉维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.40,0:13:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 萨姆 我早就告诉你要把啤酒藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, sam. told you we should have hid the beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小坏蛋们 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smartass. get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 见到你真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你也是 - 见到你真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You too. - good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你也是 特拉维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, travis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.94,0:13:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你长高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you got tall, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,多长时间没见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 快十年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, got to be 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.27,0:13:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然是 噢 那怎么说来着？奥数参赛者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still a… Oh, what was it? a mathlete?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,早不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.67,0:13:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,都这么多年了 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been too long, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 看看你们 都长大成人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at you, grown men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰一定为你们而感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}John would have been damn proud of you…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你们如此同心协力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sticking together like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊 我们很亲密无间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. yeah, we're as thick as thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么会比家庭更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more important than family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我迟到了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm late for the dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们能出面帮我这个老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for helping out an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且我还有点少胳膊少腿儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little, uh, shorthanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你们找到蒙哥马利了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you track down montgomery?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们在他家找到他的 - 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we found him at his home. - and?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们看到他那恶心的零食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he had a hell of a case of the munchies,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里生吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Topped off with a burger that he forgot to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就对了 就是他了 - 他是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's him, all right. - What's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子们 我们找到了一个洛格鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, we got a rougarou on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛格鲁（一种法国流传的食肉怪）\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rougarou?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是合成词 这听起来是合成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that made up? that sounds made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的意思是 恶心的啃食者 腐朽的牙齿 虫状的皮肤便于他们啃食\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're mean, nasty little suckers… rotted teeth, wormy skin, the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 这已经不算是人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that ain't this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 他只是套了一副皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he was wearing a cellphone on his belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很快会变得丑陋起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll turn ugly soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从本质说 他们始变于人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}They start out human, for all intents and purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 是有什么东西会导致他们变形\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, they go through some kind of metamorphosis?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就像蛆变成一只苍蝇那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, like a maggot turning into a bull fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最重要的是 他们总是很饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most of all, they're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个饥渴法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,起初 是对所有的东西 接着就会是人肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first, for everything, but then for long pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,长猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的意思是活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means human flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is my word of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们再也无法抵御那种饥饿感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunger grows in till they can't fight it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他们对着活生生的人一口咬下时 一切就开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till they got to take themselves a big, juicy chomp, and then it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会很快的完全转变\N{\fnArial\fs30}They transform completely and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我需要创可贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I need stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going? jack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬一口就全完了眼睛 牙齿 皮肤都要变异\N{\fnArial\fs30}One bite's all it takes yes, teeth, skin all turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会恢复回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No going back, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要吃过一次人 他们就永远是怪物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They feed once, they're a monster forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克就快变成这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our man jack's headed there on a bullet train.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.27,0:15:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他是人类 那你是怎么找到这家伙的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how'd you find this guy if he's a walking, talking human?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们家很不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say it runs in his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个意思是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,早在78年我就杀了他爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed his daddy back in '78.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:16:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我搞定他之前那杂种已经毁了8具尸体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch mangled eight bodies before I put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.10,0:16:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙曾是个牙医 有辆卡迪拉克 一个好太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy used to be a dentist dillac, trophy wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道点 他太太怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little did I know, pregnant trophy wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.50,0:16:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把孩子养大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She put the boy up for adoption.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我发现时他早就销声匿迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I found out, he was long gone, lost in the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.77,0:16:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是你没找到那家伙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean to tell me you couldn't find someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我是不是想找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我去猎杀可怜的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea of hunting down some poor kid…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我狠不下这个心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I'd have had the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.64,0:16:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要等下去 直到确定我找对了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. wanted to wait, make damn sure I had the right man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, i do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一杯 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能再来点花生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get some more peanuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,想喝点什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. what are you drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请客\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,表这样撒 陪我喝一杯嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't be like that. have a drink with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 那他人呢？-喂 饭桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, well, where is he? - Hey, douche bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不想跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你再说一遍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不想跟你说话 你个傻逼胖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't want to talk to you, you fat…sweaty…dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,离她远点 立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 当真要这么干？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, seriously want to do this, guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.68,0:18:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 用火烧吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, fire, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能干掉这些畜生的方法就是把它们烧成灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way I found to kill these bastards deep-fry 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可真是…恐怖哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's gonna be… horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.61,0:18:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这样对付杰克的爸爸的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you did to jack's dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没浪费时间吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not wasting any time, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.45,0:18:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人想浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}None to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.75,0:18:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙要是暴走了我们就死无全尸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy hulks out, we won't be finding bodies, just remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他没暴走呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he doesn't hulk out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.98,0:18:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了点准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did a little homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.95,0:18:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经用洛格鲁检验了下诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been checking out the lure on rougarous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.41,0:18:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我30年的经验对你来说还不够？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, my 30 years of experience not good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.95,0:18:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是这个意思 我只是想准备好罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no, i-i just wanted to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.81,0:18:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说 不是你不够 - 萨姆喜欢做调查 他就这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, not that you didn't. - Sam loves research. He does.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且喜欢放在床垫下的润蓓旁边（人体润滑剂）\N{\fnArial\fs30}He keeps it under his mattress right next to his k-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有毛病 确实有毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sickness. it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你检查过的东西当然没问题了 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, everything you said checked out, of course, but, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.47,0:19:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了些有关那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a couple of interesting stories about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,带有洛格鲁基因之类东西的的人的趣闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who have this rougarou gene or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 他们开始变异了 但不完全 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, they start to turn, but they never take the final step. really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再想想 要是他们从来不吃人肉 他们就不会完全变异\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, if they never eat human flesh, they don't fully transform.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那又怎样？不吃肉 保持人形？-基本是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what? Go vegan, stay human? - Basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.81,0:19:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者在这件事上 吃很多生肉 - 吃人肉 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or in this case, eat a lot of raw meat, just not… - Long pig. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没瞎忙活 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good on you for the due diligence, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那些都是童话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But those are fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是 每个我见过或听说过的洛格鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact is, every rougarou I ever saw or heard of…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.91,0:19:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有不吃人肉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took that bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但这也不意味着杰克也是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, that doesn't mean that jack will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.61,0:19:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.01,0:19:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀着希望坐等遇害者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit and hope and wait for a body count?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们跟他谈谈 解释下发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we talk to him, explain what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做他就能自救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, he can fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,自救？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.41,0:19:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.31,0:20:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挨过饿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever been really hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指的是被饿得死去活来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, haven't-eaten-in-days hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.41,0:20:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah. - Right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人丢了一块肥美多汁的里脊肉给你 你会不吃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody slaps a big, juicy sirloin in front of you, you walking away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他而言 我们就是这块肉 肥肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we are to him now meat on legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他是个正直的人 我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sure he's a stand-up guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但吃人纯粹是他的本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's pure, base instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.28,0:20:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物都要吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything in nature's got to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得单凭人品他就能控制自己了？-我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think he can stop himself 'cause he's nice? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不到迫不得已我们不能杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're not gonna kill him unless he does something to get killed for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.98,0:20:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.81,0:20:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:21:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 你吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. you scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.41,0:21:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我没想吓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't mean to sneak up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.55,0:21:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很火大 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm feeling pissed, jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.48,0:21:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上我只能一个人开车去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to drive myself to the hospital last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.65,0:21:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在医院待到两点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there until 2:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.55,0:21:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.95,0:21:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么了？-我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.91,0:21:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你流血了 我一阵眩晕 我只能出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw your blood, and i-i…got dizzy, and I just had to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以去打电话的 我给你留了无数条留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you could have called. I left you a dozen messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 手机没电了 我没找到公共电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. my phone died. I couldn't find a pay phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 真是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I …it was a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的…很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am…sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓不会再发生这种事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I promise it won't ever happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其对你 一位绝美的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to a wife as stunning as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.81,0:21:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.91,0:21:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小小的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, you know. one little cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.95,0:22:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前没这样过啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood's never bothered you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…i've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会困扰你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't get you off the hook, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 想想钻石 想想超大号钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Think… think diamond. think kobe-sized.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.58,0:22:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被什么上身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.91,0:22:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, jack. just slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.55,0:22:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.18,0:22:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我是说真的 停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, i mean it. stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack. ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.15,0:22:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack! stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.91,0:22:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,停手 停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.35,0:22:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.18,0:22:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.45,0:22:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底怎么回事呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.25,0:22:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.78,0:22:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们要去找那家伙聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so we're gonna go have a little chat with this guy, which,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不在行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, i'm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.75,0:23:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想确认下没有回旋的余地了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just want to make sure, if push comes, you're gonna shove.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.08,0:23:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.61,0:23:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能要活活烧死他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, odds are we're gonna have to burn this guy alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.11,0:23:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是有名有姓又有妻室\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy has a name and a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 而他老婆则有可能成为寡妇是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, who we're probably gonna make a widow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.45,0:23:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听过特拉维斯说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you heard travis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.58,0:23:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会变异 他们总是会变异\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna turn. they always turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.91,0:23:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他不会 也许他能战胜兽性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe he won't. maybe he can fight it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他战胜不了 我言尽于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe he can't. that's all I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.78,0:23:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们只是去看看好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll just have to see, then, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是这意思 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I mean, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.15,0:23:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定没有融入私人感情在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure your emotions aren't getting in the way here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.58,0:23:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.05,0:23:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不错的家伙血液中却透着点邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, nice dude, but he's got something evil inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.98,0:23:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的血液里 也许你可以联系到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in his blood. maybe you can relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.55,0:23:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.55,0:23:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.33,0:23:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车否则我跳车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the car or I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.33,0:24:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道我为什么要骗你吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to know why I've been lying to you, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.95,0:24:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就因为这些个狗屁事 - 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because of crap like this! - Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.75,0:24:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我说话的方式 在你眼中我就像个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you talk to me, the way you look at me like I'm a freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.15,0:24:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 你知道吗或许更糟 就像个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do not. - You know, or even worse, like I'm an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.25,0:24:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,分不清孰是孰非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I don't know the difference between right and wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.91,0:24:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.18,0:24:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你分得清吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know the difference, sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.85,0:24:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像深夜迷失在幽深小道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you've been kind of strolling a dark road lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.65,0:24:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不知道我经历着什么 一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what I'm going through. none.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.45,0:24:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then enlighten me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.51,0:24:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我血液中透着魔性 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got demon blood in me, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.28,0:24:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这种魔性遍布着我的全身\N{\fnArial\fs30}This disease pumping through my veins,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.68,0:24:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,去不掉也洗不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't ever rip it out or scrub it clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.85,0:24:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是全新一级的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a whole new level of freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.11,0:24:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我尽力把这个诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm just trying to take this…this curse…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.38,0:24:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,往好的一面发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}And make something good out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.51,0:24:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.05,0:25:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们去和那家伙聊聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go talk to the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.58,0:25:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说杰克 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean jack. okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.08,0:25:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·蒙哥马利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack montgomery?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.51,0:25:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆·温彻斯特 这是我哥 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sam winchester. this is my brother, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.51,0:25:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想要和你聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.01,0:25:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.51,0:25:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关你\N{\fnArial\fs30}About you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.45,0:25:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关你如何变异\N{\fnArial\fs30}About how you're changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.25,0:25:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.21,0:25:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能感觉到骨头在你皮下移位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably feeling your bones move under your skin…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.91,0:25:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,食欲到了顶峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your appetite's reaching, you know, hungry hungry hippo levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.38,0:25:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I doing so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.71,0:25:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.35,0:25:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是对某事略知一二的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're people who know a little something about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.78,0:25:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're people who can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,请听我们说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just hear us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.68,0:26:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.15,0:26:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛格鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rougarou.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.51,0:26:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像捏造的 但相信我 这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds made-up, i know, but, believe me, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.65,0:26:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我注意到一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I've noticed certain things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.95,0:26:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些奇怪的事 但我只是 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, some strange things, but I just I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.65,0:26:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我病了或是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…I'm sick or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.91,0:26:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲就是其中一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father was one of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.88,0:26:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的亲生父亲 遗传了这基因给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your real father. he passed it on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.85,0:26:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.11,0:26:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们清楚自己在说什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys listening to yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.71,0:26:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来你们是 略过那句听起来你们疯了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like you're… skip the whole "you guys sound crazy, " shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.31,0:26:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很渴望 杰克 会变得越来越渴望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hungry, jack. you're only gonna get hungrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.65,0:26:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴望什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungrier for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.41,0:26:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,人肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.95,0:26:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些人肉汉堡制作已经在你脑海中闪现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, a little manburger helper may have crossed your mind already.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.48,0:26:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.58,0:26:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情并非无法控制 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have to be like this, jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.18,0:26:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以战胜兽性 有人成功过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can fight it off. others have.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.05,0:26:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想骗你 这绝非易事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna lie to you, though. it's not gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.58,0:26:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会感觉自己是个酒鬼在威士忌中畅游\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna feel like an alcoholic swimming around in whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.81,0:27:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我要告诉你 你必须说不 否则 - 否则怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I'm telling you, you got to say no, or… - Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.15,0:27:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你尝了一次 一发而不可收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feed once, and it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.78,0:27:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们必须得制止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we'll have to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.85,0:27:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,制止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.58,0:27:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲 有人制止了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad did, Uh, somebody stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.98,0:27:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.71,0:27:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上给我滚出这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off my property right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.61,0:27:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要再让我看见你们 我就会报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you guys again, I'm calling the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.48,0:27:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你的老婆 你认识的每个人都会陷入危险之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, your wife, everybody you know, they're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.11,0:27:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.35,0:27:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不错的谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.25,0:27:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我不知道你去了哪里 但你吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, i don't know where you are, but you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.08,0:27:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家吧 我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come home. we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.98,0:27:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 杰克 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, jack, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.05,0:28:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.28,0:29:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.58,0:29:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're here to save you, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.85,0:29:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.25,0:29:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,米歇尔 我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle, i'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.25,0:29:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.18,0:29:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.35,0:29:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,米歇尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.50,0:30:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,米歇尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.13,0:30:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们都保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. we're gonna stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.26,0:30:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个男的要什么我们都给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna give this man whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.06,0:30:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何东西 拿了就走 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything. just take it and go, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.00,0:30:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about this, jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.60,0:30:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.60,0:30:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不想对你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the way that I wanted it to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.16,0:30:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.80,0:30:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经见过我朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already met some friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.26,0:30:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.93,0:30:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说如果我 听着 我谁也没伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that if I, look, I haven't hurt anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.13,0:30:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有 但你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, but you would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.26,0:30:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.96,0:31:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你个忙 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing you a favor, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 他说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, what's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.93,0:31:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她吧 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her, jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.26,0:31:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她真相 她有权知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her the truth. she deserves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.60,0:31:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让她走吧 她和此事无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let her go. she's not a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.50,0:31:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和什么无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}A part of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.43,0:31:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.20,0:31:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉 但她和这事有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really do apologize, but she is part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.63,0:31:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.63,0:31:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,米歇尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.03,0:31:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我到这以后你跟我说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…tell him what you told me when I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.86,0:31:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,米歇尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.40,0:31:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.43,0:31:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}"don't hurt me…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.00,0:31:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm pregnant."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.33,0:31:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}J-just hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.30,0:31:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们这儿多糟糕了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you see the mess we're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.96,0:32:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再犯这个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't make this mistake all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.00,0:32:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我30年内不会重复这个错误了 该了结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be around in 30 years. this has got to end now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.90,0:32:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不信我 如果我可以不做这个你让我干嘛都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't believe me, but I'd give anything not to have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.40,0:32:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.56,0:32:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,神啊 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.06,0:32:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以不这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.33,0:32:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要杀我 动手吧 但别伤害我老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to kill me, kill me, but not my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.56,0:32:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.06,0:32:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.23,0:32:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,同情你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.90,0:32:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.76,0:33:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.20,0:33:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.70,0:33:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,米歇尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.80,0:34:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我们现在可以找到特拉维斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess now we know where travis is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.10,0:34:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个傻蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stupid son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.53,0:35:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.83,0:35:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是特拉维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think that's travis?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.53,0:35:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么玩意把他丢在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's left of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.10,0:35:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对杰克的判断是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you were right about jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.06,0:35:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.42,0:36:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.55,0:36:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩现在不能接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean can't come to the phone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.75,0:36:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 如果你要敢伤害他 我向上帝发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack! if you hurt him, I swear to god!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.05,0:36:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.32,0:36:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你兄弟死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.29,0:36:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not if you don't calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.89,0:36:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 杰克 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, jack. listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.39,0:36:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门 我们来解决问题 行么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door. we can figure this out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.95,0:36:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要动动脑筋现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have ourselves a little brainstorming session.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.42,0:36:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.35,0:36:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为 你都做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. after what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.95,0:36:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 说什么呢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.19,0:36:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把你朋友送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent your friend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.29,0:36:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想把我老婆活活烧死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to burn my wife alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.95,0:36:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 为什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.12,0:36:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.75,0:37:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜变态狂都不用解释原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess psychopaths don't have to explain themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.79,0:37:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. you got to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.45,0:37:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我哥哥 我们绝对不会伤害她 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother and i, we never would have hurt her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.85,0:37:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,神啊 我饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god, i'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.59,0:37:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.09,0:37:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也没有家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't ever see my family again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.85,0:37:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩 你朋友 你把我卷进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two…your friend, you made me into this!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.19,0:37:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人让你杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's making you kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.82,0:37:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.95,0:37:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你体内有无法控制的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this dark pit inside you. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.52,0:37:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, i know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.95,0:37:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不代表你不可救药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't mean you have to fall into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.95,0:37:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用成为一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.85,0:37:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你后来看到过我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen me lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.49,0:38:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么不重要 重要的是你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter what you are. it only matters what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.59,0:38:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己选择吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.35,0:38:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.37,0:39:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的对 你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the right thing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.17,0:39:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是个怪物 他不会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy was a monster. there was no going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.50,0:39:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我想跟你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, i want to tell you I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.34,0:39:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有段时间对你太苛刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been kind of hard on you lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.24,0:39:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别多想了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.30,0:39:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that your,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.42,0:39:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的预感 让我害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, your psychic thing, it scares the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.87,0:39:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这都是一样的 我再也不会说这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's all the same, i'd really rather not talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.37,0:39:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么 你不想说了 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. what? you don't want to talk? you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.30,0:39:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing more to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.10,0:39:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不清楚跟你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't keep explaining myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.27,0:39:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没法理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't make you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.97,0:39:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不试试 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you try? I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.94,0:40:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这玩意 这他妈 这不是在你身上 是在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because th thing, this blood, it's not in you the way it's in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.27,0:40:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得亲自处理这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just something I got to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.30,0:40:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奉陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.50,0:40:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.14,0:40:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些邪灵 他们操纵烈焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}These powers, it's playing with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.44,0:40:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞定它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.80,0:40:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞定所有事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.24,0:40:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.80,0:40:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.74,0:40:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.40,0:40:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别谢我 我又不是为你做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank me. I'm not doing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.60,0:40:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是给天使或其他什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or for the angels or for anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.60,0:40:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我自己的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my choice.
